{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/ae73dfcf86731412e47c9d3b4d49789b.poster.avif?t=1772698909\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/ae73dfcf86731412e47c9d3b4d49789b.webm?t=1772698909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajgal is a narrative psychological horror game: explore nightmarish places, solve puzzles, and flee creatures your medallion can hold back for only a moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A lost mother. A haunted father. A marked daughter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you play as <strong>Sophia</strong>, a mother tormented by hallucinations and trapped in a mansion where a strange cult watches and manipulates her. Her visions lead her to a tragic fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years later, you become <strong>Paul</strong>, her husband, who receives a letter from his daughter Alison. She calls him back to the same mansion, where the shadows of his family \u2014 and of ancient deities \u2014 still linger.<br>Caught between reality and nightmare, Paul follows in his wife\u2019s footsteps, only to discover that some inheritances can never be buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/16c6913940f0fb787e3b57ecbc91dfff.poster.avif?t=1772698909\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/16c6913940f0fb787e3b57ecbc91dfff.webm?t=1772698909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where Reason Fractures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajgal is not just a horror game \u2014 it is an immersion into a shattered family story, where guilt, sacrifice, and love take on the shape of trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nightmarish, symbolic places:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Temple of Flesh</strong>, where every offering costs a piece of yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ashen Church</strong>, where regrets smolder beneath the soot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Marble Temple</strong>, cold and unyielding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Marshes</strong>, drowned in memory and deceit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between exploration, symbolic puzzles, and unsettling confrontations, every step pulls you deeper into truths that were never meant to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/35f1f4acf3bb35e52a7727497fcf0785.poster.avif?t=1772698909\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/35f1f4acf3bb35e52a7727497fcf0785.webm?t=1772698909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Descend into suffocating psychological horror</strong><br>Explore nightmarish environments, solve symbolic puzzles, and relive the fractured memories of a family scarred by guilt and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Wield an ancient artifact to survive</strong><br>Your only tool is a sacred medallion, a fragile shield against creatures you cannot defeat. Flee, hold them back for a moment, and push forward before they claim their due.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Experience a unique and haunting aesthetic</strong><br>Inspired by cosmic horror and surreal nightmares, Ajgal builds impossible temples, corrupted marshlands, and visions that scar the memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/54ec4727631116e7a2de533ba0e04063.poster.avif?t=1772698909\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/54ec4727631116e7a2de533ba0e04063.webm?t=1772698909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897060?t=1772698909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897060?t=1772698909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/4dc7f0dc8190288244557eace6284c13b1d79d4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772698909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/4dc7f0dc8190288244557eace6284c13b1d79d4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772698909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Ajgal contains strong psychological horror themes.\r\nIt features scenes of symbolic violence, psychological distress, brief non-sexual nudity (stylized, without explicit detail), and unsettling ritualistic imagery.\r\nThe story explores guilt, abandonment, and emotional trauma through a metaphorical, organic world.\r\nProgression often involves intense or disturbing actions, portrayed in a symbolic and narrative context."},"demos":[{"appid":4019250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/ae73dfcf86731412e47c9d3b4d49789b.poster.avif?t=1772698909\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/ae73dfcf86731412e47c9d3b4d49789b.webm?t=1772698909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajgal is a narrative psychological horror game: explore nightmarish places, solve puzzles, and flee creatures your medallion can hold back for only a moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A lost mother. A haunted father. A marked daughter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you play as <strong>Sophia</strong>, a mother tormented by hallucinations and trapped in a mansion where a strange cult watches and manipulates her. Her visions lead her to a tragic fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years later, you become <strong>Paul</strong>, her husband, who receives a letter from his daughter Alison. She calls him back to the same mansion, where the shadows of his family \u2014 and of ancient deities \u2014 still linger.<br>Caught between reality and nightmare, Paul follows in his wife\u2019s footsteps, only to discover that some inheritances can never be buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co