l horror</strong><br>Explore nightmarish environments, solve symbolic puzzles, and relive the fractured memories of a family scarred by guilt and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Wield an ancient artifact to survive</strong><br>Your only tool is a sacred medallion, a fragile shield against creatures you cannot defeat. Flee, hold them back for a moment, and push forward before they claim their due.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Experience a unique and haunting aesthetic</strong><br>Inspired by cosmic horror and surreal nightmares, Ajgal builds impossible temples, corrupted marshlands, and visions that scar the memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/54ec4727631116e7a2de533ba0e04063.poster.avif?t=1772698909\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/extras/54ec4727631116e7a2de533ba0e04063.webm?t=1772698909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio Echo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897060/a39c97fa3e9ae3a2e32850343af7c16efe95cc9d/header.jpg?t=1772698909","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897060/528914954/b24f92f17fe8cfce4e7731a46491fbc764bcddf0/1760680653/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760681417","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897060/528914954/b24f92f17fe8cfce4e7731a46491fbc764bcddf0/1760680653/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760681417","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897060/